title: The Independents
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and uspd_timer <= 0 and uspd_exists = 1
on-arrival: uspd_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: germany

= The Independents

[? if uspd_split = 0 : The Independent Social Democrats stand between Ebert's party and ours. Their left wing is close to us, and has hundreds of thousands of members in Halle, Leipzig and Berlin; their leaders are not. ?][? if uspd_split = 1 : Since Halle, the Independents who refused Moscow's conditions carry on as a smaller party under Crispien, Dittmann and Hilferding, drifting back towards the SPD. Some of their workers still look to us. ?]

- @joint: Propose joint action to the USPD.
- @left_wing: Court the USPD's left wing.
- @denounce: Denounce the USPD leaders as traitors.
- @easy_discard

@joint
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Improves relations with both social democratic parties. The radicals object.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any united front.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.uspd_relation += 10;
Q.spd_relation += 3;
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 10;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 8;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Our proposal for joint demonstrations is received with interest by the Independents.

@left_wing
subtitle: Small gains, especially in Halle.
on-arrival: {!
Q.uspd_relation += 4;
Q.district_halle_members += (Q.uspd_split ? 0.3 : 0.5) * Math.max(1, Q.district_halle_members / 10);
Q.worker_support += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

Some of the Independents' most radical members cross over to us.

@denounce
subtitle: Pleases the radicals.
on-arrival: {!
Q.uspd_relation -= 10;
Q.offensive_satisfaction += 5;
if (!Q.ultraleft_gone) {
    Q.ultraleft_satisfaction += 5;
}
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

We denounce the Independents as half-hearted traitors. They return the favour.
